---

## What We Are Building

Closing the gap between "the pipeline exists" and "it actually flows + the operator (Полина) can drive it." E12 had been generated **planless** (storyboard → reference images directly, bypassing the per-shot Designer→Critic→revision chain) because two automated gates produced **false-REVISE** and stalled the chain, and casting had been skipped. The Director's instinct ("разве у нас должно быть так?") was correct — that planless state is the disease, not the norm. This session: root-caused the stall, converted the over-strict gates to advisory (block→warning), got E12 onto the real chain (Casting → Designer → Critic → Reference Artist), and hardened the operator-facing failure modes (shotId guessing, Anthropic 529, inert Revise notes, Полина batching/over-caution).

---

## What WORKED (with evidence)

- **q5/q6 (`d5fd9a5`)** — pilot = first N shots (`pickPilotShots` → `shots.slice(0,n)`, fixes SH02-skip + fan-out desync) + restored per-shot `agent_started` in the v2 EREF handler. tsc·0, 951 vitest, 30 replay-pilot. Live feed later showed `Reference Designer started — A1-SC02-SH04` ✓.
- **block→warning (`0099443`)** — continuity state-ledger soft drift (`reviseImpactForMajorPool(canonConflicts)` instead of full majorPool) + CREAD readability REVISE → advances to WCHK instead of bouncing storyboard. tsc·0, 951 vitest, 30 replay-pilot.
- **Casting unblocked E12 (Director drove Полина)** — `SPC-episode_cast-v01` created with `smartphone` in cast ✓; chain then ran Designer → EPREV PASS → CREAD PASS → Reference Artist. Confirmed in feed + DB.
- **Smartphone canon FIXED** — SH03 plan text = "Sky Blue #6EC6E8" (correct); image v03 (post-cast) = BLUE phone (viewed it); v02 (planless) was black. Casting + object-reference-contract (`70f8da2`, on master) attach the blue canon image once the object is `inCast`. The black phone was a **symptom of skipped casting**, not a code bug.
- **shotId SH-resolver (`e4cd902`)** — `getStoryboardShotById` now falls back to the unique SH token when exact id misses (designers were failing on a misremembered scene, e.g. `A1-SC01-SH03` vs canon `A1-SC02-SH03`). Guarded on unique match. tsc·0, 955 vitest (+4 new), 30 replay-pilot. Live: SH04 then started cleanly with the right id.
- **Gemini fallback on Anthropic 529 (`38cac52`)** — `generateAnthropicText` catches `overloaded_error` (529) and falls back to Gemini free tier; result tagged `provider:'gemini-fallback'`; Designer plan description shows "⚠ Gemini fallback (Anthropic 529)". `GEMINI_API_KEY` present, `TEXT_LLM_DEBUG_TIER=false` (Anthropic stays primary). tsc·0, 955 vitest, 30 replay-pilot. SH03 went through after the fallback shipped.
- **EREF Revise-with-note auto-fires Designer (`78e18bb`)** — approve route on REQUEST_REVISION of `IMG-episode_ref`/`IMG-anchor` now fires `sandystudio/exec-eref-designer/plan` with `{episodeId, shotId, revisionNote}` (reuses the regenerateRefPlan path; Designer threads note as HARD ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA). Plan-mode approved. tsc·0, 955 vitest, 30 replay-pilot.
- **Полина training rules 11 + 12 (`26f7f23`, `9544790`)** — rule 11: Designer is per-shot (`regenerateRefPlan(shotId)`), never `triggerAgent('EXEC-EREF-DESIGNER')` batch. rule 12: Designer ≠ Reference-Artist queue (don't gate one on the other); read status before proposing an approval (she kept offering to approve already-APPROVED plans).
- **Servers restarted clean** — killed :3000/:8288, relaunched from main checkout; `/api/inngest` 200, inngest listening. Pushed `842560f..e4cd902` to origin.

