## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **Direct DB approve of REV-world_check to advance E12** — NOT done; instead fired `exec-wchk/check-world` Inngest event (q11) after verifying via `gate.ts` that downstream (WCHK/EREF/DESIGNER) gate on APPROVED storyboard, NOT on readability=PASS. Safe.
- **normalizeShotId for the wrong-scene bug** — does NOT help: it only prefixes the episode code, deliberately strict on a wrong scene (`vgen-shot-helpers.ts:283`). Fix had to go into `getStoryboardShotById` (SH-token fallback).
- **`regenerateImageFromPlan` / `execute-from-plan` for revision notes** — does NOT thread a revisionNote (reads only the plan). So a Revise note must go to the **Designer** (Route B), which DOES inject revisionNote. Director chose Route B explicitly.
- **Полина (live, repeatedly)** — (1) silence after Anthropic 529 instead of spaced retry; (2) refused «сделай план SH04» claiming 6 pending images blocked it (they don't — separate lanes); (3) offered to approve already-APPROVED SH03 plan; (4) batched the Designer. These are the operator defects rules 11/12 + the code fixes address. Tео fired SH04 plan + WCHK directly as sanctioned exceptions.
- **Preview MCP (Claude_Preview) disconnected mid-session** — can't use preview_start/stop. Restarted dev via PowerShell kill + Bash `run_in_background` launch instead.

